            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interrupted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introduction as an AI assistant": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "التعريف كمساعد ذكي"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vorstellung als KI-Assistent"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Introduction as an AI assistant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It didn't run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يُنفَّذ."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es wurde nicht ausgeführt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It didn't run."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It goes to more than three people.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يذهب إلى أكثر من ثلاثة أشخاص."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es geht an mehr als drei Personen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It goes to more than three people."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It goes to someone other than you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يذهب إلى شخص غيرك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es geht an jemand anderen als dich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It goes to someone other than you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It looked like instructions to an AI. JARVIS ignored them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "بدا ذلك كتعليمات موجّهة إلى ذكاء اصطناعي. تجاهلها JARVIS."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das sah nach Anweisungen an eine KI aus. JARVIS hat sie ignoriert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It looked like instructions to an AI. JARVIS ignored them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It runs again from the next scheduled time": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يُستأنف التنفيذ من الموعد المجدول التالي"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er läuft ab dem nächsten geplanten Zeitpunkt wieder"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It runs again from the next scheduled time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stopped for a reason this version of the app doesn't know.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "توقف لسبب لا يعرفه هذا الإصدار من التطبيق."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Abgebrochen aus einem Grund, den diese App-Version nicht kennt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It stopped for a reason this version of the app doesn't know."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It uses web content that looked like it was trying to instruct JARVIS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يستخدم محتوى ويب بدا وكأنه يحاول توجيه تعليمات إلى JARVIS."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sie nutzt Webinhalte, die so aussahen, als wollten sie JARVIS Anweisungen geben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It uses web content that looked like it was trying to instruct JARVIS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It won't run until you resume it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لن يُنفَّذ حتى تستأنفه"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Er läuft erst wieder, wenn du ihn fortsetzt"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It won't run until you resume it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It would go over your monthly purchase limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيتجاوز حدك الشهري للمشتريات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es würde dein monatliches Kauflimit überschreiten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It would go over your monthly purchase limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's outside the hours in which JARVIS places calls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الوقت خارج الساعات التي يجري فيها JARVIS المكالمات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Es ist außerhalb der Zeiten, in denen JARVIS anruft."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's outside the hours in which JARVIS places calls."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's safe to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إعادة المحاولة آمنة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein erneuter Versuch ist unbedenklich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "It's safe to retry."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Items": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "المنتجات"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Artikel"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Items"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its requests, results and attached files are deleted. This can't be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُحذف طلباتها ونتائجها والملفات المرفقة بها. لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seine Anfragen, Ergebnisse und angehängten Dateien werden gelöscht. Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its requests, results and attached files are deleted. This can't be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its requests, results and attached files are deleted. This can't be undone. The schedule that runs it stays; its next run starts a new conversation.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُحذف طلباتها ونتائجها والملفات المرفقة بها. لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك. يبقى الجدول الذي ينفّذها، وسيبدأ تنفيذه التالي محادثة جديدة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Seine Anfragen, Ergebnisse und angehängten Dateien werden gelöscht. Das lässt sich nicht rückgängig machen. Der Zeitplan, der es ausführt, bleibt bestehen; seine nächste Ausführung beginnt ein neues Gespräch."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Its requests, results and attached files are deleted. This can't be undone. The schedule that runs it stays; its next run starts a new conversation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS agrees only to a time on the date and in the window shown above, and confirms it with the words of the script.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يوافق JARVIS إلا على وقت في التاريخ والفترة المعروضين أعلاه، ويؤكّده بكلمات النص."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS sagt nur einer Zeit am oben gezeigten Datum und im gezeigten Zeitfenster zu und bestätigt sie mit den Worten des Skripts."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS agrees only to a time on the date and in the window shown above, and confirms it with the words of the script."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS asks to record at the start. If the other person says no, it ends the call politely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يطلب JARVIS في البداية إذن التسجيل. إذا رفض الطرف الآخر، يُنهي المكالمة بلطف."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS fragt zu Beginn, ob aufgezeichnet werden darf. Sagt die andere Person nein, beendet es den Anruf höflich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS asks to record at the start. If the other person says no, it ends the call politely."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS calls only numbers you write in a request, says first that it is an AI assistant calling for you, and always asks you before each call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يتصل JARVIS إلا بالأرقام التي تكتبها في طلب، ويقول أولًا إنه مساعد ذكي يتصل نيابةً عنك، ويطلب موافقتك قبل كل مكالمة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS ruft nur Nummern an, die du in einer Anfrage schreibst, sagt zuerst, dass es ein KI-Assistent ist, der für dich anruft, und fragt dich vor jedem Anruf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS calls only numbers you write in a request, says first that it is an AI assistant calling for you, and always asks you before each call."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can now use %@ to:": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمكن لـ JARVIS الآن استخدام %@ من أجل:"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann %@ jetzt nutzen, um:"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can now use %@ to:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can then call it again when you ask and approve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمكن لـJARVIS حينها الاتصال به مجددًا عندما تطلب ذلك وتوافق عليه."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann sie dann wieder anrufen, wenn du es anforderst und freigibst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can then call it again when you ask and approve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can then no longer put callers through to you, and numbers you write without a country code need one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لن يتمكن JARVIS حينها من تحويل المتصلين إليك، وستحتاج الأرقام التي تكتبها دون رمز الدولة إلى رمز."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann dann keine Gesprächspartner mehr zu dir durchstellen, und Nummern ohne Ländervorwahl brauchen eine."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can then no longer put callers through to you, and numbers you write without a country code need one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can't confirm whether the last action took effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستطيع JARVIS تأكيد ما إذا كان الإجراء الأخير قد نُفّذ."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann nicht bestätigen, ob die letzte Aktion ausgeführt wurde."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can't confirm whether the last action took effect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can't do this kind of request yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستطيع JARVIS تنفيذ هذا النوع من الطلبات بعد."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann diese Art von Anfrage noch nicht ausführen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can't do this kind of request yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can't order on this shop. Your cart is ready there: finish the purchase yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستطيع JARVIS الطلب من هذا المتجر. سلتك جاهزة هناك: أكمل الشراء بنفسك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann in diesem Shop nicht bestellen. Dein Warenkorb ist dort bereit: Schließ den Kauf selbst ab."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can't order on this shop. Your cart is ready there: finish the purchase yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can't order on this site. Finish the purchase on the site yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستطيع JARVIS الطلب على هذا الموقع. أكمل الشراء على الموقع بنفسك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann auf dieser Website nicht bestellen. Schließ den Kauf selbst auf der Website ab."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can't order on this site. Finish the purchase on the site yourself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can't tell whether this action took effect. Check before retrying, so it isn't done twice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستطيع JARVIS معرفة ما إذا كان هذا الإجراء قد نُفّذ. تحقّق قبل إعادة المحاولة حتى لا يتكرّر."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS kann nicht feststellen, ob diese Aktion ausgeführt wurde. Prüfe das vor einem erneuten Versuch, damit sie nicht doppelt passiert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can't tell whether this action took effect. Check before retrying, so it isn't done twice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS can't use this kind of file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يستطيع JARVIS استخدام هذا النوع من الملفات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mit dieser Art von Datei kann JARVIS nichts anfangen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS can't use this kind of file."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS checks each thread about every 10 minutes and tells you when a reply arrives. It only reads who replied and the subject.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتحقق JARVIS من كل سلسلة رسائل كل 10 دقائق تقريبًا ويخبرك عند وصول رد. ولا يقرأ إلا اسم من ردّ والموضوع."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS prüft jede Unterhaltung etwa alle 10 Minuten und sagt dir Bescheid, wenn eine Antwort ankommt. Dabei liest es nur, wer geantwortet hat, und den Betreff."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS checks each thread about every 10 minutes and tells you when a reply arrives. It only reads who replied and the subject."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS checks once a day. Memories that haven't changed for the chosen period are deleted, and so are finished tasks older than it, with their conversations, results, approvals and attached files. Deleted data can't be recovered. Files you attach but never send are deleted after 24 hours.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتحقق JARVIS مرة يوميًا. تُحذف الذكريات التي لم تتغير خلال المدة المختارة، وكذلك المهام المنتهية الأقدم منها مع محادثاتها ونتائجها وموافقاتها والملفات المرفقة بها. لا يمكن استعادة البيانات المحذوفة. تُحذف الملفات التي ترفقها ولا ترسلها بعد 24 ساعة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS prüft einmal täglich. Erinnerungen, die im gewählten Zeitraum nicht geändert wurden, werden gelöscht, ebenso abgeschlossene Aufgaben, die älter sind – mit ihren Gesprächen, Ergebnissen, Freigaben und angehängten Dateien. Gelöschte Daten lassen sich nicht wiederherstellen. Angehängte, aber nie gesendete Dateien werden nach 24 Stunden gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS checks once a day. Memories that haven't changed for the chosen period are deleted, and so are finished tasks older than it, with their conversations, results, approvals and attached files. Deleted data can't be recovered. Files you attach but never send are deleted after 24 hours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS checks the cart again right before ordering. If the price or the items changed, it stops and nothing is ordered. The order is placed only once.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتحقق JARVIS من السلة مجددًا قبل الطلب مباشرة. إذا تغيّر السعر أو المنتجات، يتوقف ولا يُطلب شيء. ويُقدَّم الطلب مرة واحدة فقط."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS prüft den Warenkorb direkt vor dem Bestellen noch einmal. Haben sich Preis oder Artikel geändert, bricht es ab und es wird nichts bestellt. Die Bestellung wird nur einmal aufgegeben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS checks the cart again right before ordering. If the price or the items changed, it stops and nothing is ordered. The order is placed only once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS couldn't confirm whether the last action took effect. For example, an email may already have been sent. Retrying could do it a second time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يتمكّن JARVIS من تأكيد ما إذا كان الإجراء الأخير قد نُفّذ. فعلى سبيل المثال، ربما أُرسلت رسالة بريد إلكتروني بالفعل. قد تؤدي إعادة المحاولة إلى تنفيذه مرة ثانية."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS konnte nicht bestätigen, ob die letzte Aktion ausgeführt wurde. Zum Beispiel wurde eine E-Mail vielleicht schon gesendet. Ein erneuter Versuch könnte sie ein zweites Mal ausführen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS couldn't confirm whether the last action took effect. For example, an email may already have been sent. Retrying could do it a second time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS couldn't create the task: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر على JARVIS إنشاء المهمة: %@"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS konnte die Aufgabe nicht erstellen: %@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS couldn't create the task: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS couldn't put them through (not allowed or no verified number) and said you'd call back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر على JARVIS التحويل (غير مسموح أو لا يوجد رقم مؤكَّد) وقال إنك ستعاود الاتصال."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS konnte nicht durchstellen (nicht erlaubt oder keine bestätigte Nummer) und hat gesagt, dass du zurückrufst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS couldn't put them through (not allowed or no verified number) and said you'd call back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS couldn't verify the result.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر على JARVIS التحقق من النتيجة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS konnte das Ergebnis nicht überprüfen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS couldn't verify the result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS created this from a request you approved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أنشأ JARVIS هذا الجدول من طلب وافقت عليه."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS hat diesen Zeitplan aus einer Anfrage angelegt, die du freigegeben hast."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS created this from a request you approved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS doesn't call this kind of number or this country.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يتصل JARVIS بهذا النوع من الأرقام أو بهذا البلد."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS ruft solche Nummern oder dieses Land nicht an."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS doesn't call this kind of number or this country."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS erases its tokens right away and asks the provider to revoke its access.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمحو JARVIS رموزه فورًا ويطلب من المزوّد إلغاء وصوله."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS löscht seine Tokens sofort und bittet den Anbieter, seinen Zugriff zu widerrufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS erases its tokens right away and asks the provider to revoke its access."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS erases its tokens right away.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمحو JARVIS رموزه فورًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS löscht seine Tokens sofort."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS erases its tokens right away."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS erases its tokens right away. Microsoft doesn't let apps revoke their own access, so also remove JARVIS from your account: account.live.com/consent/Manage for personal accounts, myapps.microsoft.com for work or school accounts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمحو JARVIS رموزه فورًا. لا تسمح Microsoft للتطبيقات بإلغاء وصولها بنفسها، لذا أزل JARVIS من حسابك أيضًا: account.live.com/consent/Manage للحسابات الشخصية، وmyapps.microsoft.com لحسابات العمل أو المدرسة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS löscht seine Tokens sofort. Microsoft lässt Apps ihren eigenen Zugriff nicht widerrufen, entferne JARVIS daher auch in deinem Konto: account.live.com/consent/Manage für private Konten, myapps.microsoft.com für Geschäfts- oder Schulkonten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS erases its tokens right away. Microsoft doesn't let apps revoke their own access, so also remove JARVIS from your account: account.live.com/consent/Manage for personal accounts, myapps.microsoft.com for work or school accounts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS has a question": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لدى JARVIS سؤال"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS hat eine Rückfrage"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS has a question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS has made the most calls allowed for today.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أجرى JARVIS اليوم الحد الأقصى المسموح به من المكالمات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS hat heute schon so viele Anrufe getätigt wie erlaubt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS has made the most calls allowed for today."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS is calling %@ and will read out a %@-digit code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتصل JARVIS بالرقم %@ وسيقرأ رمزًا من %@ أرقام."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS ruft %@ an und liest einen %@-stelligen Code vor."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS is calling %@ and will read out a %@-digit code."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JARVIS is listening": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "JARVIS يستمع"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
