    "Requests JARVIS runs for you on a schedule. Every run is planned and checked like a new request, and anything that needs your approval still asks you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "طلبات ينفّذها JARVIS نيابةً عنك وفق جدول. يُخطَّط لكل تنفيذ ويُفحص كأنه طلب جديد، وما يحتاج إلى موافقتك يظل يسألك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anfragen, die JARVIS nach Zeitplan für dich ausführt. Jede Ausführung wird wie eine neue Anfrage geplant und geprüft, und was deine Freigabe braucht, fragt dich weiterhin."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Requests JARVIS runs for you on a schedule. Every run is planned and checked like a new request, and anything that needs your approval still asks you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Requests: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الطلبات: %@"
          }
        },
        "de": {
