            "state": "translated",
            "value": "They declined the recording."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They said something that looked like instructions to an AI. JARVIS ignored it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "قال الطرف الآخر شيئًا بدا كتعليمات موجّهة إلى ذكاء اصطناعي. تجاهله JARVIS."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
