    },
    "This needs a connected service. Connect it in Settings › Connections.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يحتاج هذا إلى خدمة متصلة. اربطها من الإعدادات › الاتصالات."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dafür braucht es einen verbundenen Dienst. Verbinde ihn unter Einstellungen › Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This needs a connected service. Connect it in Settings › Connections."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This needs your approval. Please review it on screen and tap Approve or Decline — I can't take approvals by voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يحتاج هذا إلى موافقتك. يُرجى مراجعته على الشاشة والضغط على «موافقة» أو «رفض» — لا أستطيع قبول الموافقات صوتيًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dafür brauche ich deine Freigabe. Bitte prüfe sie auf dem Bildschirm und tippe auf „Freigeben“ oder „Ablehnen“ – Freigaben per Sprache kann ich nicht annehmen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This needs your approval. Please review it on screen and tap Approve or Decline — I can't take approvals by voice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This number asked not to be called again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "طلب صاحب هذا الرقم عدم الاتصال به مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Nummer möchte nicht mehr angerufen werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This number asked not to be called again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This number won't be called again": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لن يُتصل بهذا الرقم مرة أخرى"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Nummer wird nicht mehr angerufen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This number won't be called again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This order wasn't placed, and nothing was charged by JARVIS.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يُقدَّم هذا الطلب، ولم يُحصّل JARVIS أي مبلغ."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Bestellung wurde nicht aufgegeben, und JARVIS hat nichts abgebucht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This order wasn't placed, and nothing was charged by JARVIS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request conflicts with an earlier one. Start it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتعارض هذا الطلب مع طلب سابق. ابدأه من جديد."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Anfrage steht im Konflikt mit einer früheren. Starte sie neu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This request conflicts with an earlier one. Start it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request has expired.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انتهت صلاحية هذا الطلب."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Anfrage ist abgelaufen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This request has expired."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This request has expired. Nothing will be done; retry the task to ask again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انتهت صلاحية هذا الطلب. لن يُنفَّذ أي شيء؛ أعد محاولة المهمة لطلب الموافقة مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Anfrage ist abgelaufen. Es wird nichts ausgeführt; versuche die Aufgabe erneut, um wieder zu fragen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This request has expired. Nothing will be done; retry the task to ask again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This saves a draft in your mailbox. Nothing is sent; you can review and send it yourself later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يحفظ هذا مسودة في صندوق بريدك. لا يُرسل شيء؛ ويمكنك مراجعتها وإرسالها بنفسك لاحقًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Damit wird ein Entwurf in deinem Postfach gespeichert. Es wird nichts gesendet; du kannst ihn später selbst prüfen und senden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This saves a draft in your mailbox. Nothing is sent; you can review and send it yourself later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This schedule repeats in a way this app can't edit. You can change its name and request here, and its timing in JARVIS on the web.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتكرر هذا الجدول بطريقة لا يستطيع هذا التطبيق تعديلها. يمكنك تغيير اسمه وطلبه هنا، ومواعيده من JARVIS على الويب."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Zeitplan wiederholt sich auf eine Weise, die diese App nicht bearbeiten kann. Name und Anfrage änderst du hier, die Zeiten in JARVIS im Web."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This schedule repeats in a way this app can't edit. You can change its name and request here, and its timing in JARVIS on the web."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This schedule was deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "حُذف هذا الجدول."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieser Zeitplan wurde gelöscht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This schedule was deleted."
          }
        }
