          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When someone asks JARVIS not to call again, their number goes on this list and every later call to it is refused. Only a masked form is kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عندما يطلب أحد من JARVIS عدم الاتصال مجددًا، يُضاف رقمه إلى هذه القائمة ويُرفض كل اتصال لاحق به. لا يُحتفظ إلا بصيغة مُخفاة منه."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn jemand JARVIS bittet, nicht mehr anzurufen, kommt die Nummer auf diese Liste und jeder spätere Anruf dorthin wird abgelehnt. Gespeichert wird nur eine maskierte Form."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When someone asks JARVIS not to call again, their number goes on this list and every later call to it is refused. Only a masked form is kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever runs this JARVIS server hasn't set up sign-in with %@ yet (it needs a client ID and secret), so it can't be connected here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لم يُعدّ مشغّل خادم JARVIS هذا تسجيل الدخول عبر %@ بعد (يتطلب ذلك معرّف عميل وسرًّا)، لذا لا يمكن ربطه هنا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer diesen JARVIS-Server betreibt, hat die Anmeldung mit %@ noch nicht eingerichtet (dafür braucht es eine Client-ID und ein Secret), daher lässt es sich hier nicht verbinden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whoever runs this JARVIS server hasn't set up sign-in with %@ yet (it needs a client ID and secret), so it can't be connected here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why JARVIS is asking": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لماذا يسأل JARVIS"
